OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday will be a fresher day
OL,6,Fthan recently. Patchy cloud at first
OL,7,Fwill break up to give sunny spells
OL,8,Fduring the day, although the odd light
OL,9,Fshower is also possible, mostly
OL,10,Ftowards the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny showers will ease
OL,13,Fovernight, leaving a mostly clear and
OL,14,Fdry night to come. Feeling rather cool
OL,15,Fcompared to recent nights.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FA dry and bright start to
OL,18,FFriday with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,19,FCloud builds through the morning,
OL,20,Fleading to a few isolated showers,
OL,21,Flocally perhaps heavy by the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
